  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The outbuilding hereby permitted shall be moved to the approved location within 6 months from the date of this permission.\r\nReason: To ensure the outbuilding is relocated and any harm to neighbouring property is in line with policies LP1 and LP2..",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed outbuilding shall be painted dark green as agreed via email on 17/08/26 within 6 months of the date of this permission.\r\nReason: In the interest of the appearance of the development in accordance with Council policy LP1.",
    "Condition : 3 - The development shall be carried out in accordance with the reports, specifications and drawings detailed [Planning Statement; Email regarding the painting of the outbuilding dated 17/08/26; 21-001-FUL-5; 21-001-FUL-6 and 21-001-FUL-7.]. \r\nReason: To ensure a satisfactory standard of development and to allow the local planning authority to review any potential changes to the scheme. \r\n",
    "Condition : 4 - INFORMATIVE: In dealing with this application the Council has implemented the requirement in the National Planning Policy Framework to work with the applicant in a positive and proactive manner and the Council has, as far as practicable, sought solutions to problems arising in relation to dealing with the planning application. The Council has made available detailed advice in the form of its statutory policies in the Local Plan (2023) as well as offering a full pre-application advice service, in order to ensure that the applicant has been given every opportunity to submit an application which is likely to be considered favourably. In addition, where appropriate, further guidance was offered to the applicant during the processing of the application."
